    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, while the image still moves through one encoder-to-decoder flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a feature field before any compact thinking begins. Windowing prepares local token groups for the thought process. The recurrent ticks stay inside DQ-CTM, so the loop does not restart the encoder or decoder. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across those ticks.",
